			"notes": "There was an issue where structure bounding boxes were moved vertically from where they were supposed to be. This happens because when some structures are generated they are also moved vertically into their final spots. I added a whole system for doing things to certain structures and so the part of the generation code that moves them down has been extracted and put there. They are now in the same spot as in vanilla."
