			"notes": "The mod updated to 1.16.2 and because of (really small) breaking changes, it is not compatible with earlier versions.\n\nAdditionally, there's now the option to include a spawn platform.\nFor that you just add a datapack with the structures `protosky:spawn_overworld` and/or `protosky:spawn_nether`.\nThanks to @martmists for that PR!\n\nWe've also bumped the required loader version to a modern 0.9, so keep that in mind when updating."
