			"notes": "# ProtoSky 1.0.0\nThe official initial release!\nWe tested this quite a bit and it should be funtional now, but if you find any issues, let us know!\nQuick rundown of what's in this release:\n- Remove almost all blocks and entities in all worlds while preserving all bounding boxes of structures.\n- Keep end portal frames in their exact position (but without any eyes of ender)\n- Keep the obsidian pillar and the end crystals on top (they respawn anyway)\n- Keep the exit end portal (forced it to generate above y0)\n\nKeep in mind that this mod itself doesn't generate any starting blocks! You need to place those yourself.\nIt also doesn't set your world spawn in your nether, you can set your spawn point in the nether yourself,\nbut this will have to be redone whenever you use a bed or respawn anchor.\n\nThis mod is intended to be run using fabric loader."
		}
